[I] The window management library for the Cinnamon desktop

[T] The window management library for the Cinnamon desktop (libmuffin) and its
[T] sample WM binary (muffin). Muffin is a fork of Mutter, specifically adapted
[T] to work as the window manager for the Cinnamon desktop environment.

[U] https://github.com/linuxmint/muffin

